      IRMAA Calculator (Multi-Year)
    </h1>
    
    <p class="irmaa-hero-date">Figures last verified against official sources in July 2026.</p>

    <div class="irmaa-aeo-block" style="background: #0A3D3A; border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; margin: 1.25rem 0;">
      <p style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #C9933A; margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;">Quick Answer</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">In 2026, Medicare IRMAA begins at $106,000 MAGI (single) or $212,000 (joint). Tier 1 adds $81.20/mo to Part B. The highest earners above $500,000/$750,000 pay $443.90/mo extra. SSA uses your tax return from two years prior to determine your bracket.</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="irmaa-who-for" style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1rem 0 0 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem;">
      <li style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-text-muted, #4B5A6E);"><span aria-hidden="true" style="color: #0A3D3A; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0;">→</span> Retirees with income above $100,000 who want to see if they owe an IRMAA surcharge on their Medicare premiums.</li>
      <li style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-text-muted, #4B5A6E);"><span aria-hidden="true" style="color: #0A3D3A; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0;">→</span> Seniors planning large IRA withdrawals, Roth conversions, or investment sales who want to know the IRMAA impact before acting.</li>
      <li style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-text-muted, #4B5A6E);"><span aria-hidden="true" style="color: #0A3D3A; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0;">→</span> People who just received an IRMAA determination letter and want to independently verify which tier applies to their income.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="irmaa-hero-sub">
      Instantly check if your income triggers a Medicare Part B or Part D IRMAA surcharge. 100% free — no signup, no account, no email required. Compare current vs. next year income side-by-side.
    </p>
    <p class="irmaa-hero-source">
      Based on official 2026 CMS IRMAA brackets (Standard Part B premium: {STANDARD_PART_B_2026}). Last reviewed: {lastReviewed}. Not affiliated with CMS or SSA.
    </p>
  </div>


  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       2. INTERACTIVE TOOL (FRONT AND CENTER)
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
